{"seq":2,"slug":"references-and-borrowing","title":"引用与借用规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ownership-and-borrowing/references-and-borrowing","wordCount":787,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"引用与借用规则\">引用与借用规则</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>借用（Borrowing）是在<strong>不转移所有权</strong>的前提下访问数据的方式，引用（Reference）是它的具体实现。它的价值在于让&quot;访问&quot;与&quot;拥有&quot;解耦：调用者保留所有权，被调用者只在一段可验证的期限内读取或修改数据。理解本篇的关键，是把握借用检查器背后的两条不变式——<strong>可变即独占，共享即只读</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>共享引用 <code>&amp;T</code></strong>：只读，可同时存在多个，前提是没有活跃的可变引用。</li>\n<li><strong>可变引用 <code>&amp;mut T</code></strong>：可读写，同一时刻只能有一个，且与任何共享引用互斥。</li>\n<li><strong>NLL</strong>：引用的生命周期在最后一次使用时结束，而非作用域末尾，这让许多直觉上合法的代码得以通过编译。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"借用的核心思想\">借用的核心思想</h2><p>借用（Borrowing）允许在<strong>不转移所有权</strong>的情况下访问数据。引用（Reference）是借用的具体实现——它是一个指向数据的指针，但不拥有数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn calculate_length(s: &amp;String) -&gt; usize {&#10;    s.len()&#10;} // s 离开作用域，但它不拥有数据，所以不会 drop&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let s = String::from(&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;    let len = calculate_length(&amp;s); // 借用 s，不转移所有权&#10;    println!(&quot;&#39;{}&#39; 的长度是 {}&quot;, s, len); // s 仍然有效&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn calculate_length(s: &#x26;String) -> usize {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    s.len()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} // s 离开作用域，但它不拥有数据，所以不会 drop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let s = String::from(\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let len = calculate_length(&#x26;s); // 借用 s，不转移所有权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"'{}' 的长度是 {}\", s, len); // s 仍然有效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"共享引用与可变引用\">共享引用与可变引用</h2><p>Rust 提供两种引用类型，它们遵循严格的互斥规则。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>权限</th>\n<th>数量限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享引用</td>\n<td><code>&amp;T</code></td>\n<td>只读</td>\n<td>同时可存在多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可变引用</td>\n<td><code>&amp;mut T</code></td>\n<td>读写</td>\n<td>同一时刻最多一个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    let mut s = String::from(&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let r1 = &amp;s;&#10;    let r2 = &amp;s;&#10;    println!(&quot;{} {}&quot;, r1, r2); // 多个共享引用同时存在，合法&#10;&#10;    let r3 = &amp;mut s;&#10;    r3.push_str(&quot;, world&quot;);&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, r3); // 可变引用独占使用&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut s = String::from(\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r1 = &#x26;s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r2 = &#x26;s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{} {}\", r1, r2); // 多个共享引用同时存在，合法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r3 = &#x26;mut s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    r3.push_str(\", world\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", r3); // 可变引用独占使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"借用检查器规则\">借用检查器规则</h2><p>借用检查器（Borrow Checker）在编译期执行以下核心规则：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[创建引用] --&gt; B{引用类型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|&amp;T 共享引用| C[检查: 无活跃可变引用]&#10;    B --&gt;|&amp;mut T 可变引用| D[检查: 无任何其他活跃引用]&#10;    C --&gt; E[允许多个共享引用共存]&#10;    D --&gt; F[确保独占访问]&#10;    E --&gt; G[引用生命周期结束]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[创建引用] --&gt; B{引用类型?}\n    B --&gt;|&amp;T 共享引用| C[检查: 无活跃可变引用]\n    B --&gt;|&amp;mut T 可变引用| D[检查: 无任何其他活跃引用]\n    C --&gt; E[允许多个共享引用共存]\n    D --&gt; F[确保独占访问]\n    E --&gt; G[引用生命周期结束]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><h3 id=\"规则一-可变引用独占\">规则一：可变引用独占</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    let mut s = String::from(&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let r1 = &amp;mut s;&#10;    // let r2 = &amp;mut s; // 编译错误：不能同时拥有两个可变引用&#10;    r1.push_str(&quot;!&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut s = String::from(\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r1 = &#x26;mut s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // let r2 = &#x26;mut s; // 编译错误：不能同时拥有两个可变引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    r1.push_str(\"!\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"规则二-共享与可变互斥\">规则二：共享与可变互斥</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    let mut s = String::from(&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let r1 = &amp;s;&#10;    // let r2 = &amp;mut s; // 编译错误：已有共享引用时不能创建可变引用&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, r1);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut s = String::from(\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r1 = &#x26;s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // let r2 = &#x26;mut s; // 编译错误：已有共享引用时不能创建可变引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", r1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"规则三-nll-non-lexical-lifetimes\">规则三：NLL（Non-Lexical Lifetimes）</h3><p>Rust 2021 Edition 引入了 NLL，引用的生命周期在<strong>最后一次使用</strong>时结束，而非在作用域末尾。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    let mut s = String::from(&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let r1 = &amp;s;&#10;    let r2 = &amp;s;&#10;    println!(&quot;{} {}&quot;, r1, r2);&#10;    // r1 和 r2 在此之后不再使用，生命周期结束&#10;&#10;    let r3 = &amp;mut s; // 合法！共享引用已不再活跃&#10;    r3.push_str(&quot;, world&quot;);&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, r3);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut s = String::from(\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r1 = &#x26;s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r2 = &#x26;s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{} {}\", r1, r2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // r1 和 r2 在此之后不再使用，生命周期结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r3 = &#x26;mut s; // 合法！共享引用已不再活跃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    r3.push_str(\", world\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", r3);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"悬垂引用防护\">悬垂引用防护</h2><p>Rust 编译器保证引用永远不会悬垂（Dangling）——引用指向的数据一定是有效的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// fn dangle() -&gt; &amp;String {&#10;//     let s = String::from(&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;//     &amp;s // 编译错误：s 在函数结束时被释放，返回的引用将指向无效内存&#10;// }&#10;&#10;fn no_dangle() -&gt; String {&#10;    let s = String::from(&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;    s // 返回所有权，而非引用&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// fn dangle() -> &#x26;String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     let s = String::from(\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     &#x26;s // 编译错误：s 在函数结束时被释放，返回的引用将指向无效内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn no_dangle() -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let s = String::from(\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    s // 返回所有权，而非引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"引用与切片\">引用与切片</h2><p>切片（Slice）是对连续数据序列的引用，是借用机制最常见的实际应用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn first_word(s: &amp;str) -&gt; &amp;str {&#10;    let bytes = s.as_bytes();&#10;    for (i, &amp;byte) in bytes.iter().enumerate() {&#10;        if byte == b&#39; &#39; {&#10;            return &amp;s[..i];&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    &amp;s[..]&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let s = String::from(&quot;hello world&quot;);&#10;    let word = first_word(&amp;s);&#10;    println!(&quot;第一个单词: {}&quot;, word);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn first_word(s: &#x26;str) -> &#x26;str {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let bytes = s.as_bytes();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (i, &#x26;byte) in bytes.iter().enumerate() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if byte == b' ' {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return &#x26;s[..i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x26;s[..]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let s = String::from(\"hello world\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let word = first_word(&#x26;s);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"第一个单词: {}\", word);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见切片类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>切片类型</th>\n<th>拥有者类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&amp;str</code></td>\n<td><code>String</code></td>\n<td>字符串切片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;[T]</code></td>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>数组切片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;[u8]</code></td>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;u8&gt;</code> / <code>&amp;[u8; N]</code></td>\n<td>字节切片</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"借用规则对比总览\">借用规则对比总览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>共享引用 <code>&amp;T</code></th>\n<th>可变引用 <code>&amp;mut T</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>是否转移所有权</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否可修改数据</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否与其他共享引用共存</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否与可变引用共存</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否实现 <code>Copy</code></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程安全标记</td>\n<td><code>Send + Sync</code>（若 <code>T: Sync</code>）</td>\n<td><code>Send</code>（若 <code>T: Send</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实用模式-借用与方法\">实用模式：借用与方法</h2><p>结构体方法通过 <code>&amp;self</code> 和 <code>&amp;mut self</code> 体现借用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"struct Counter {&#10;    value: u64,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Counter {&#10;    fn get(&amp;self) -&gt; u64 {&#10;        self.value&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn increment(&amp;mut self) {&#10;        self.value += 1;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn into_value(self) -&gt; u64 {&#10;        self.value&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let mut c = Counter { value: 0 };&#10;    c.increment();&#10;    c.increment();&#10;    println!(&quot;当前值: {}&quot;, c.get());&#10;    let final_val = c.into_value(); // 消耗 c 的所有权&#10;    println!(&quot;最终值: {}&quot;, final_val);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>struct Counter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    value: u64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Counter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn get(&#x26;self) -> u64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn increment(&#x26;mut self) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.value += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn into_value(self) -> u64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut c = Counter { value: 0 };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c.increment();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c.increment();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"当前值: {}\", c.get());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let final_val = c.into_value(); // 消耗 c 的所有权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"最终值: {}\", final_val);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法签名</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>所有权影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&amp;self</code></td>\n<td>不可变借用</td>\n<td>调用后可继续使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;mut self</code></td>\n<td>可变借用</td>\n<td>调用后可继续使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>self</code></td>\n<td>获取所有权</td>\n<td>调用后原值被消耗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>借用把&quot;访问&quot;与&quot;所有权&quot;分离，是 Rust 不必到处 <code>.clone()</code> 的根本原因。</li>\n<li>两条核心规则：<strong>可变引用独占</strong>，<strong>共享与可变互斥</strong>；编译器在编译期完成全部检查。</li>\n<li>借用检查器同时保证引用<strong>永不悬垂</strong>，从根本上消除 use-after-free。</li>\n<li>切片（<code>&amp;str</code>、<code>&amp;[T]</code>）是借用最常见的实际应用，方法签名中的 <code>&amp;self</code>/<code>&amp;mut self</code>/<code>self</code> 则体现了三种所有权语义。</li>\n<li>NLL 让引用在实际不再使用后即可释放借用，显著放宽了书写约束。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"引用与借用规则","id":"引用与借用规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"借用的核心思想","id":"借用的核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"共享引用与可变引用","id":"共享引用与可变引用"},{"level":2,"text":"借用检查器规则","id":"借用检查器规则"},{"level":3,"text":"规则一：可变引用独占","id":"规则一-可变引用独占"},{"level":3,"text":"规则二：共享与可变互斥","id":"规则二-共享与可变互斥"},{"level":3,"text":"规则三：NLL（Non-Lexical Lifetimes）","id":"规则三-nll-non-lexical-lifetimes"},{"level":2,"text":"悬垂引用防护","id":"悬垂引用防护"},{"level":2,"text":"引用与切片","id":"引用与切片"},{"level":2,"text":"借用规则对比总览","id":"借用规则对比总览"},{"level":2,"text":"实用模式：借用与方法","id":"实用模式-借用与方法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"所有权规则与移动语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ownership-and-borrowing/ownership-rules"},"next":{"title":"生命周期标注","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ownership-and-borrowing/lifetimes"}}